  owl:Ontology and owl:Restriction arrive as ordinary data with no method. While
  adding them I found owl_Thing, owl_NamedIndividual, owl_Restriction and
  owl_Ontology had no single-argument constructor — yet rdf_type.jl:45 calls
  owl_Thing(s) with one argument. Any rdf:type owl:Thing triple would have
  thrown.

